a validation and typed Parquet conversion dependencies. These support a potential integration boundary; the supplied evidence does not establish compatibility with the proposed accounting Avro schema, consistent with the premise's explicit qualification.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"manual"},{"claimId":"p31","ref":"7/c5","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The common-artifact S004 LLD referenced as prior art exists at the declared repository path.","evidence":"Reading docs/epics/one-common-model-every-artifact-E202610192f27754d/S004/LLD.md:1 succeeded and returned `<!-- insrc:artifact LLD-2f27754d4ad00b8e-s4 -->`, confirming the S004 LLD exists at the declared path.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"manual"},{"claimId":"p32","ref":"7/c9","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The code evidence reference c9 resolves to line 21 of the declared model-token-usage review evidence file.","evidence":"The supplied read of plans/evidence/model-token-usage-tu1-review-evidence.md:21 was FOUND and begins `c9 | Source src/workflow/artifact-core/store.ts`, confirming that reference c9 resolves to the declared file and line.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"manual"},{"claimId":"p33","ref":"7/c10","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The code evidence reference c10 resolves to line 23 of the declared model-token-usage review evidence file.","evidence":"The provided read of plans/evidence/model-token-usage-tu1-review-evidence.md:23 is FOUND and begins `c10 | Source src/workflow/artifact-core/journal.ts`, confirming that c10 resolves to line 23 of the declared evidence file.","action":"none — verified sound","fixability":"manual"},{"claimId":"p34","ref":"7/c15","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The stakeholder root-storage decision referenced as c15 exists at its declared path and line.","evidence":"The read of plans/evidence/model-token-usage-root-storage-decision.json:1 returned the stakeholder de